{
  "texts": [
    "About",
    "Work",
    "Wenjia SHI",
    "Integrated Designer",
    "Lab Research Project",
    "2023.09 -- ongoing",
    "The Lexicon of Wish",
    "How non-existent plants generated by artificial intelligence can be used as a coding tool for wishes, connecting past wishes with contemporary wishes and generating an atmosphere for future change.",
    "#DesignResearch",
    "Explore how non-existent plants generated  by artificial intelligence can be used as a coding tool for wishes.",
    "Pipeline",
    "Stage 1",
    "Stage 2",
    "Analyze scraped comment data for value is like finding the seed elements to grow a flower of hope.",
    "Cultivate a 'xian' herb, define its healing powers, and imbue it with our deepest wishes.",
    "'Xian' Herb",
    "Living in cities\u2014massive man-made megaprojects\u2014much of our time is spent in the virtual digital world, bombarded with a flood of troubling information: global economic downturns, rising unemployment rates, wars. We've lost our sense of hope for the future and are instead solely focused on solving immediate problems.",
    "In Chinese mythology, whether in",
    "Journey to the West",
    "or",
    "Flowers in the Mirror",
    ", the celestial gardens of the heavens represent an ideal, abundant, and beautiful spiritual world that humanity aspires to.",
    "Value Driven Research",
    "The value system of ancient Chinese is \u2018\u798f\u7984\u5bff\u559c\u8d22\u2019, which is different from the value system of modern people. We use a universally recognized conversion method to translate the values of the ancients into Schwarz's Ten value systems.",
    "As a code of aspiration and generation, this transformation connects traditional Chinese values with Western values, and traditional Chinese aspirations with modern aspirations to form a non-binary AI generation model.",
    "Model Training",
    "Use a batch of images with Chinese style for LoRA training, and then test the application in Stable Diffusion.",
    "In this way, it is possible to learn the correspondence between plant form and desire, so that the projection can be applied to contemporary aspirations.",
    "'Xian' herb",
    "Wish",
    "Crawl the content of comment posts related to \"wish\" from three social media.",
    "AI is then used to score value orientation against the Schwartz value system.",
    "Use a 'xian' herb to represent contemporary people's needs.",
    "GPT analyzes the image and the value, gives it a name and judge its efficacy.",
    "1",
    "/",
    "7"
  ],
